SIH26060 ANTARCTIC EDGEOPS — WINDOWS SETUP

Prerequisite: Node.js 18.18+ (Node 20 LTS recommended).

Every service now checks its own Node version on startup. If your Node is
too old you will see a clear "NODE.JS VERSION TOO OLD" message telling you
exactly what to do, instead of a confusing crash.

Do not use Linux syntax such as:
STATION_ID=maitri node agent.js

Use the Windows-safe commands below.

WINDOW 1
cd central-control-plane
npm install
npm start

WINDOW 2
cd station-edge-agent
npm install
npm run maitri

WINDOW 3
cd station-edge-agent
npm run bharati

WINDOW 4
cd sync-engine
npm install
npm start

WINDOW 5
cd researcher-control-tower
npm install
npm run dev

Open http://localhost:3000
